<title>USA: Fed buys all coupons 5-15-1999 through 3-31-2002.</title>
<headline>Fed buys all coupons 5-15-1999 through 3-31-2002.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dealers said the Federal Reserve was buying coupons of all maturities.</p>
<p>The Fed later confirmed it was buying all coupons maturing from May 15, 1999, to March 31, 2002. It said delivery would be Tuesday.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
